# 8-Bit Music Box song
# The Road to Boston - our own fife-and-drum / marching band arrangement.
# Tune and second voice: "Boston March / Road to Boston" from A. Robinson Jr.'s
# Massachusetts collection (Exeter, 1820, p. 63) - public domain - via the
# Traditional Tune Archive. Everything else (drum parts, band scoring, harmony,
# introduction and ending) is ours. Form: 2-bar drum roll-off; AABB for the corps
# (two fifes, field drum, bass drum); AABB again with the band (trumpet on the
# tune, clarinet on the second voice, horn off-beats, tuba, snare, cymbals);
# a held chord over a roll, and a final hit.
format 1
title "The Road to Boston (fife, drum & band)"
tempo 120
time 2/4
key 2
bars 68

